","characterName":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第15話_39db79552f\/元女子校の日常　第15話_39db79552f.027.jpeg","animationName":"なし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_027_操夢.wav","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceDuration":3.45172335600907,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","seVolume":1,"title":"シーン 27","seStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"slideTitle":"スライド #27","duration":4.05172335600907,"telop":"そして、机の中に手を入れると、あるものを取り出す。","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"39F51735-7590-49C9-8EFE-7855FD77753B","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第15話_39db79552f\/元女子校の日常　第15話_39db79552f.028.jpeg","animationName":"なし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_028_操夢.wav","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceDuration":3.7212925170068027,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","seVolume":1,"title":"シーン 28","seStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"slideTitle":"スライド #28","duration":4.321292517006802,"telop":"その瞬間、周りからある囁き声が聞こえる…、それは…","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"2B35FAC5-EC5D-43A9-AAE5-353875F3BA88","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第15話_39db79552f\/元女子校の日常　第15話_39db79552f.029.jpeg","animationName":"